flowchart TD
    A([Issue in Triage]) --> B[Owner bot proposes options]
    B --> C{Human decides<br/>in a comment}
    C -->|needs clarification| NI[Needs Input]
    NI --> C
    C -->|brief written| D[Coordinator starts worker,<br/>issue stays in Backlog]
    D --> D2[Worker pushes<br/>a first commit]
    D2 --> D3[Coordinator opens draft PR<br/>with a closing link,<br/>issue card to Active]
    D3 --> E[Worker pushes code and tests<br/>to the draft PR]
    E --> F{Coordinator<br/>pre-check}
    F -->|fails| E
    F -->|passes| G[Mark ready<br/>card to Auto Review]
    G --> H{Automated review<br/>round ≤ cap}
    H -->|P1 or P2 finding| I[Back to draft, In Progress<br/>worker fixes the root cause,<br/>neighboring cases + tests]
    I --> J[Coordinator verifies fix,<br/>resolves thread]
    J -->|under the cap| G
    J -->|cap reached:<br/>coordinator verifies,<br/>no more automated rounds| K
    H -->|clean| K{Coordinator<br/>post-check}
    K --> L[Merge into staging branch,<br/>redeploy, verify staging serves<br/>a commit containing the head,<br/>screenshots in the PR if visible]
    L --> M{Gate into<br/>Human Review}
    M -->|passes| N[Human Review]
    M -->|fails| I
    N -->|changes requested<br/>or late finding| I
    N -->|human merges| O([Main])
